          "modbus_baudrate": "Baud rate"
        },
        "description": "Connect over RS-485 with **38400 8N1** by default (slave **0xA0**). Enable **External Control / ModBus RTU** in the Conow app before continuing."
      },
      "tcp": {
        "title": "Modbus TCP (Ethernet adapter)",
        "data": {
          "device_name": "Device name",
          "modbus_host": "Host / IP address",
          "modbus_tcp_port": "TCP port",
          "modbus_slave": "Slave address"
        },
        "description": "Connect to your RS-485↔Ethernet adapter (TCP port **502** by default, slave **0xA0**). The adapter converts Modbus TCP to RTU — the device itself needs no changes."
      },
      "tcp_direct": {
        "title": "Modbus TCP (direct all-in-one)",
        "data": {
          "device_name": "Device name",
          "modbus_host": "Host / IP address",
          "modbus_tcp_port": "TCP port",
          "modbus_slave": "Slave address",
          "tcp_verify_code": "Verification code"
        },
        "description": "Connect to the all-in-one machine's own Ethernet port (TCP port **502** by default, slave **0xA0**). No RS-485↔Ethernet adapter is involved. Enter the **8-character hexadecimal verification code** shown on the machine; it is written to holding registers **0x2701–0x2702** (9985–9986) and the connection is accepted only if the device confirms it."
      }
    },
